mso-border-bottom-alt:0.5000pt solid windowtext;">
                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p><span style="font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;">This course introduces the basic theory of traditional Chinese medicine properties and the principles of compound prescriptions for selecting and designing effective ingredients, effective parts, compound formulas, and new dosage forms of traditional Chinese medicine; Classification of new drug registration for traditional Chinese medicine and natural medicine, development status in China and abroad. Common new technologies for processing, extracting, purifying, and formulating traditional Chinese medicine and their applications in new drug development will be introduced. Introduce the technology and cutting-edge development of quality standards and stability research for traditional Chinese medicine new drugs, as well as the requirements and procedures for the efficacy and toxicity research of traditional Chinese medicine and natural medicine new drugs, laying the foundation for the future development of traditional Chinese medicine and natural medicine new drugs.</span></p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><o:p></o:p></span></p>
                </td>
            </tr>
