                    <p class=MsoNormal><span style="font-family:仿宋;mso-bidi-font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:12.0000pt;
mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border-color: #ccc; border: 1px solid #000000; height: 2406px; width: 754px;" border="1" width="650">
<tbody>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 57.375px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>周数</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 355.115px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="302">
<p>教学内容与教学目标</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 105.073px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="113">
<p>形式</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 43.2917px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>学时</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 125.188px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="140">
<p>授课教师</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 57.375px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>1</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 355.115px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="302">
<p>中药新药研发的发展概况</p>
<p>1、中药新药研发的发展历史及其研发风险</p>
<p>2、植物药研发国内外的发展状况与管理要求</p>
<p>3、掌握中药新药的最新分类和要求，对不同类别的新药具有清楚的认识和归纳</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 105.073px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="113">
<p>课堂教学</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 43.2917px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 125.188px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="140">
<p>秦晶</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 57.375px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 355.115px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="302">
<p>中药药性及炮制基本原理及常见技术方法</p>
<p>1、掌握中药药性基本概念</p>
<p>2、掌握炮制的基本原理及其对药物性质的影响</p>
<p>3、了解常见炮制技术及常用辅料</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 105.073px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="113">
<p>课堂教学</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 43.2917px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 125.188px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="140">
<p>秦晶</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 57.375px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>3</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 355.115px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="302">
<p>中药复方组方基本原理及其特点</p>
<p>1、 掌握中药复方组方基本原理</p>
<p>2、 掌握君臣佐使基本概念及其对新药研发的重要性</p>
<p>3、 了解中医基本理论和特点，理解中医认识疾病的基本规律</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 105.073px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="113">
<p>课堂教学</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 43.2917px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>2</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 125.188px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="140">
<p>秦晶</p>
</td>
</tr>
<tr>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 57.375px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="47">
<p>4</p>
</td>
<td style="padding: 0.4rem; padding: 0.4rem; width: 355.115px; border: 1px solid #000000;" width="302">
<p>中药新药研发的立题与研究内容设计</p>
